            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Caroline"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This makes a delicious smoothie. I have to admit that I skipped the juicing part... for one because I don't have a juicer, and two because I didn't think it was necessary. This has just a few simple ingredients and the pineapple does make it frothy and thick. Sooo good! I will definitely make this again. Be warned that each serving is huge, not that it's a bad thing!"
